label s18
text @[Tomoya]
text ...
text Wait... should I really be saying it's good?
text As her boyfriend, wouldn't pointing out my girlfriend's weaknesses actually be better?
text Let's say I tell her this is good; will she believe what I say and keep making food like that...?
text Which means... in the end, I'll keep eating stuff like that.
text That would be terrible.
