label s19
text @[Tomoya]
text ...
text It's terrible... It's true that it's terrible.
text But is it really okay if I just come right out and say that straight up?
text Since I'm her boyfriend, I need to handle this with care when I tell her...
text That's right. I can't just slam her cooking for how bad it is.
text I should tell her what's bad about it... no, that's wrong. I should tell her what she can do to improve.
text As for ways that she can improve her tamagoyaki...
text ......
text I am drawing a blank...
